# SQL Development Ignore Rules

This repository is intended for SQL practice and query development. The following files and patterns are ignored to avoid committing secrets, local database state, or editor artifacts.

# Secrets and credentials
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.env
config.ini
config.json
credentials.json
secrets.json
connection.json
connection*.json
*.pem
*.key
*.crt
*.p12
*.pfx
*.ppk

# Database and local state
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.bak
*.backup
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.log

# Temporary SQL files
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Local editor artifacts
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python tooling
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
venv/
.venv/

# Node tooling (if used later)
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# OS files
desktop.ini
